This allows businesses to offload open-ended tasks to the cloud.

14
00:00:28,189 --> 00:00:32,590
The agent can directly produce code, reports, spreadsheets, or business outcomes.

15
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:37,280
Its goal is to lower the engineering barrier for enterprises to build and deploy agents.

16
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:40,400
This allows teams to integrate agents into real-world business operations more quickly.

17
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,580
